From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: yugidraft <yugidraft@localhost>
Date: Sat, 3 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] core: apply FFA surrender at once outside an open chain

Debug.SurrenderDuelist flags a surrender and checks only pending
surrenders. It preserves living seats' open choices and does not settle LP,
Deck or effect-win losses of an unfinished operation. Current chains
finish before removal. Pending losses still suppress unresolved links.
Debug.EliminateDuelist keeps its old timing for time-limit losses.
Suspended pre-chain activations and summons cancel safely on removal.
Living opponent picks reject removed seats.

